    "description": "Share of households with no internet subscription of any kind, pale to deep blue. Measured over all 32,819 ZIP Code Tabulation Areas with a published value: 6 classes with breaks at 3%/6%/9.5%/14%/22%, which fall at the 20th/39th/59th/77th/91st percentile of the national distribution. 50.02% of ZIP Code Tabulation Areas have a coefficient of variation above 0.3 at this geography, too many to fade without washing the map out, so read pct_no_internet_moe in the GeoParquet before drawing a conclusion from any single ZCTA.",
